SYS1.ISPF.PREFS		Settings	Terminal and user parameters
-			View		Display source data or listings
-			Edit		Create or change source data
-			Utilities	Perform utility functions
SYS1.ISPF.CAL		Calendar	Process calendars
-			Notes		Process notes and messages
-			Documents	Process documents
SYS1.ISPF.CALC		Calculator	Fast floating point processing
SYS1.ISPF.XCALC		XCALC		Perform floating point processing
SYS1.ISPF.CLOCK		Clock		Full screen clock
SYS1.ISPF.SYSTEM	System		System management functions
